<h1 class="page-title">Studio</h1>
<p class="sec__label">Creative technology services</p>
<div class="prose">
  <p>Commissioned and collaborative work runs through my studio, <strong>Modular Muse</strong>.
  Custom hardware and software for interactive experiences, exhibits, and instruments — from
  brainstorming first concepts through iterative prototypes to a system that survives the public run.</p>

  <h2>What that looks like</h2>
  <ul class="factlist">
    <li>Expressive, Interactive installations and exhibits, built to be handled by the public</li>
    <li>Custom electronics: embedded systems, PCB design and layout, motor and sound actuation</li>
    <li>Software for desktop, mobile, and embedded — C/C++, JavaScript, openFrameworks, Processing, Max/MSP, Pd</li>
    <li>Technical direction and prototyping alongside artists, exhibit designers, and researchers</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Toolkits</h2>
  <p>Some of these methods are packaged as hardware anyone can build on.
